---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About">
  <article class="wrap about">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <!-- TODO: draft together via Q&A -->
      <p>
        I came to engineering from design, and I still work at the seam between the two:
        scoping features with product and backend, then sweating the states nobody drew.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most recently I spent almost five years on the rewards and loyalty team at Recharge,
        shipping memberships, punch cards and cancellation prevention in both Vue and React.
        Before that: Vejo (Flutter, Shopify Liquid), Ad Exchange Group (React dashboards,
        Shopify themes), and freelance work since 2014.
      </p>
      <p><a href="/resume.pdf">Résumé (PDF)</a></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .about { padding-top: 3rem; }
  h1 { font-size: var(--step-5); letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
</style>
